        "evidence": "quantum-su2.md states the FULL relations including KEK⁻¹=q²E, KFK⁻¹=q⁻²F, [E,F]=(K−K⁻¹)/(q−q⁻¹). quantum-su2.lean:36-51 `QuantumSu2` encodes ONLY K_inv_left/K_inv_right (KK⁻¹=1); the E/F generators are declared but the defining relations KEK⁻¹=q²E, KFK⁻¹=q⁻²F, [E,F]=… are ABSENT from the structure. The Lean models a near-trivial 'ring with two distinguished invertible-pair elements', not U_q(su(2)).",
